checkers: unknown command `frobnicate`

checkers — the Checkers build tool

USAGE:
    checkers check|run|build|trust|stage|parse ...   run the compiler, `ckc` (see `ckc --help`)
    checkers fmt [--check] [PATH]...                 format .ck files (see `checkers fmt --help`)
    checkers fmt -                                   format standard input
    checkers --version

In a directory with checkers.json, the compiler commands first fetch the package's
dependencies and update checkers.lock; the file defaults to main.ck.
`ckc` is found through CKC, else next to `checkers`, else on PATH.
